routine rep_inm op=6C,6D page=rep bookx="2+18+(13+2W)n" n=4 diff=7 why="OPEN: silicon longer than the book (measured, the extra words OPEN): (qprobe round 11, Q35) REP INM: the head (14 words, B the fifth), the iteration `X D Z D` (14 + the cycles' waits), the tail `. . . . . . . N .` (the qprobe r11c runs; F24-out-r-rep-inm-w-n2-pE-w0)"
