routine rep_outm op=6E,6F page=rep bookx="2+18+(13+2W)n" n=4 diff=9 why="OPEN: silicon longer than the book (measured, the extra words OPEN): (qprobe round 11, Q35) REP OUTM: the head (15 words, B the fifth), the iteration `Y D X . . . . .`, the last `Y D . X . . . . .`, the tail `. . . . . . . N .` (the qprobe r11c runs; F24-out-r-rep-outm-w-n2-pE-w0)"
